9308578_1726514455191874_6308026798597834484_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UTx6X0vF9L4Q7kNvwHa-vKf&_nc_oc=AdoRkNiE_oUS4FLCyc_qxZgzFfzHo699RA8HUjb0ongIXsfZIYFsLGfbr_LVBUYpJM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMkareERZfgp2TgtWZezNxSpul_OXsgk0lYQR1isCP4YQ&oe=6AC138A8"}, {"file_name": "MainGame_1080p_03.06.2026_14-29-20.png", "id": "1404029614944673", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507828589_1404029618278006_7062782397021647292_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wfs5ogOvmRoQ7kNvwEDNQI_&_nc_oc=AdrSSLprHvDJNRBqztiwkYSx8UtVDtsrIyMjW7oyLxrKMJFAxTku8vxQ9pLqHdLEp4Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBR8BCZpO5ab25r2Cja1_t7DeQVIrOTnMMAfKkYXtVTA&oe=6AC1380F"}, {"file_name": "PVPMap_1080p_03.06.2026_14-29-31.png", "id": "1515091350405309", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507829691_1515091357071975_7013173856802386450_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GXtKPMSpr7sQ7kNvwHo31Jm&_nc_oc=AdpG5VChg9g4PcAsPSk-rT1mzprWTKBiD6khyYuSGi9U_cmScylU2U4RXBFqB98phUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN6KZAjj2g-sbHInU02RX_XthtR01AiTT3buxDOznihfA&oe=6AC10E1B"}, {"file_name": "Shop_1080p_17.06.2026_01-37-15.png", "id": "1372860788371060", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499297170_1372860791704393_7054576886672805749_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n2zgFVz_nlcQ7kNvwE-ZKyP&_nc_oc=Adp-GoPjx0J14N0jgXdaA0xTA4yDYRtOAIH_Z3Y08gF73O9AMxPP3FiQFJ37boTo6rU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBeQR_47GTQPJ-4KxfLrXmdDU8PhvdBebAnqmKUAJCNw&oe=6AC11192"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Gibrilla Tag", "keywords": ["Gorilla", "Tag", "Gibbon", "Monkey", "Ape"], "long_description": "**Welcome to Gibrilla Tag!**\n\nGibrilla Tag is an exciting VR fangame built around **gorilla locomotion**, where you play as a nimble **gibbon** and explore unique environments using your arms to run, climb, jump, and swing. Travel through forests, beaches, caves, and mysterious underground areas filled with secrets waiting to be discovered.\n\nMaster the game's special **vine mechanics** to swing across gaps, reach hidden locations, and move through maps in creative ways. Whether you're racing around with friends, exploring every corner of the map, or practicing advanced movement techniques, there's always something new to learn.\n\nLooking for competition? Jump into **Gun Game**, where players battle through a variety of weapons while trying to climb the leaderboard and prove their skills. If you're brave enough, venture into the game's **Horror** experiences, featuring dark environments, creepy atmospheres, and unexpected scares that will keep you on edge.\n\nGibrilla Tag also includes custom maps, hidden areas, fun cosmetics, regular updates, and plenty of unique features designed to make every session feel different. Whether you enjoy exploring, movement challenges, socializing, competitive gameplay, or horror adventures, Gibrilla Tag has something for everyone.\n\n**Swing through the trees, uncover secrets, survive the darkness, and become the ultimate gibbon in Gibrilla Tag!** ", "short_description": "Gibrilla Tag is a fast-paced VR fangame that uses gorilla locomotion, letting you swing, climb, and move like a gibbon through forests, caves, and mysterious environments. Explore the map using unique vine mechanics, compete in an exciting Gun Game mode, and test your courage in the game's Horror experiences. With fun movement, custom maps, and plenty of surprises, Gibrilla Tag offers a fresh adventure packed with cool features and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": "RGXStudio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacy-policy-gibrilla-tag", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Realzz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "ht